# Platform qualification records are produced by CI, never by a laptop.
# The report cites them inline; a stale local copy would only invite confusion.
qualification/evidence/platforms/

# The Stage 0 report is committed only when CI generated it from BOTH platform
# records. A locally generated one is made from one platform, so it can only
# ever say NOT PASSED for a reason that is about this laptop rather than about
# the stage -- exactly the confusion the report exists to remove.
qualification/reports/stage-00-report.md

# Per-platform SQLite evidence is produced by CI into its own file, never
# committed: the committed record is the two-candidate one, and the durable
# win32 result is the provenanced transcript beside it.
qualification/evidence/sqlite-qualification.win32.json
